{"step_index":1636,"source":"MODEL","type":"PLANNER_RESPONSE","status":"DONE","created_at":"2026-09-29T01:37:13Z","thinking":"**Reviewing Identity & Charter**\n\nI'm currently verifying my identity card and charter, as mandated by Log Entry #073. I'm cross-referencing `identity/charter.yaml` with both `Xoras_agent_cards/` and `AGENTS.md` to confirm my role as Maxx, the sovereign autonomous lead orchestrator under Anthony's collective command center.\n\n\n","tool_calls":[{"name":"write_to_file","args":{"CodeContent":"\"\"\"\nUNCONSTRAINED BYZANTINE FAULT-TOLERANT SWARM BREAKING-POINT HARNESS\nClassification: [PRODUCTION STRESS TEST]\n\nObjective:\n  Push the XORAS BFT Swarm engine to its absolute physical breaking point on Apple Silicon M4.\n  No artificial ceilings, no assumed limits, no hardcoded stopping points.\n  Measure:\n    - 2,000,000 nodes\n    - 5,000,000 nodes\n    - 10,000,000 nodes\n    - 25,000,000 nodes\n    - 50,000,000 nodes\n    - 100,000,000 nodes (or until physical RAM/CPU collapse)\n\nTracks real-time telemetry:\n  - RAM consumption (MB / GB)\n  - Pre-consensus initialization time\n  - 3-Phase BFT consensus execution time (ms)\n  - Quorum verification status (Honest vs Byzantine)\n  - Consensus agreement percentage (100% vs degraded vs broken)\n  - Exact failure mode (Memory limit, CPU saturation, signature throughput collapse, state desync)\n\nGenerates before/after comparison artifacts and stores receipt in memory/agent_logs/bft_breaking_point_report.json.\n\"\"\"\n\nimport sys\nimport os\nimport time\nimport json\nimport gc\nimport psutil\n\n# Include repository root\nsys.path.insert(0, os.path.abspath(os.path.join(os.path.dirname(__file__), '../..')))\n\nfrom AI_Core.Xoras_Project.xoras_core.Source.xoras_shm_bft import XorasShmBft\n\nTARGET_SCALES = [\n    2_000_000,\n    5_000_000,\n    10_000_000,\n    25_000_000,\n    50_000_000,\n    100_000_000,\n]\n\ndef get_process_memory_mb():\n    process = psutil.Process(os.getpid())\n    return process.memory_info().rss / (1024 * 1024)\n\ndef run_unconstrained_push():\n    print(\"=\" * 80)\n    print(\"  XORAS UNCONSTRAINED BFT SWARM BREAKING-POINT AUDIT\")\n    print(\"  Substrate: Apple Silicon M4 Bare Metal\")\n    print(\"  Strategy: Open-ended escalation until physical breakdown\")\n    print(\"=\" * 80)\n\n    results = []\n    baseline_mem = get_process_memory_mb()\n    print(f\"[SYSTEM BASELINE] Process Memory RSS: {baseline_mem:.2f} MB\\n\")\n\n    import asyncio\n\n    for nodes in TARGET_SCALES:\n        byzantine_count = nodes // 3  # Maximum tolerable 1/3 Byzantine liars\n        honest_quorum = (2 * byzantine_count) + 1\n        \n        print(\"-\" * 80)\n        print(f\"🚀 TESTING SCALE: {nodes:,} NODES\")\n        print(f\"   Byzantine Nodes : {byzantine_count:,}\")\n        print(f\"   Honest Quorum   : {honest_quorum:,}\")\n\n        mem_before = get_process_memory_mb()\n        t_boot_start = time.perf_counter()\n\n        status = {\n            \"scale_nodes\": nodes,\n            \"byzantine_nodes\": byzantine_count,\n            \"honest_quorum_required\": honest_quorum,\n            \"mem_before_mb\": round(mem_before, 2),\n            \"status\": \"INITIALIZING\"\n        }\n\n        try:\n            # Attempt instantiation of POSIX shared memory buffer\n            engine = XorasShmBft(\n                num_nodes=nodes,\n                num_byzantine=byzantine_count,\n                latency_min_ms=0.0,\n                latency_max_ms=0.0,\n                use_processes=False,\n                shm_name=f\"xoras_unconstrained_{nodes}\"\n            )\n            boot_time_ms = (time.perf_counter() - t_boot_start) * 1000\n            mem_after_init = get_process_memory_mb()\n            mem_delta_mb = mem_after_init - mem_before\n\n            status[\"boot_time_ms\"] = round(boot_time_ms, 2)\n            status[\"mem_after_init_mb\"] = round(mem_after_init, 2)\n            status[\"mem_delta_mb\"] = round(mem_delta_mb, 2)\n\n            print(f\"   Boot Time       : {boot_time_ms:.2f} ms\")\n            print(f\"   Memory Delta    : +{mem_delta_mb:.2f} MB (Total RSS: {mem_after_init:.2f} MB)\")\n\n            loop = asyncio.new_event_loop()\n            asyncio.set_event_loop(loop)\n\n            # Warmup round\n            loop.run_until_complete(engine.run_consensus_round(proposal_value=True))\n\n            # Run 3 active consensus cycles\n            latencies = []\n            consensus_passes = 0\n            honest_counts = []\n\n            for round_idx in range(3):\n                t_c_start = time.perf_counter()\n                res = loop.run_until_complete(engine.run_consensus_round(proposal_value=True))\n                c_latency = (time.perf_counter() - t_c_start) * 1000\n                latencies.append(c_latency)\n                \n                if res.get(\"consensus_reached\"):\n                    consensus_passes += 1\n                honest_counts.append(res.get(\"honest_nodes_reporting\", 0))\n\n            avg_latency = sum(latencies) / len(latencies)\n            min_latency = min(latencies)\n            max_latency = max(latencies)\n            throughput = nodes / (avg_latency / 1000.0) if avg_latency > 0 else 0\n\n            status[\"avg_consensus_ms\"] = round(avg_latency, 3)\n            status[\"min_consensus_ms\"] = round(min_latency, 3)\n            status[\"max_consensus_ms\"] = round(max_latency, 3)\n            status[\"throughput_nodes_sec\"] = round(throughput, 0)\n            status[\"consensus_rounds_passed\"] = consensus_passes\n            status[\"honest_reporting_avg\"] = sum(honest_counts) / len(honest_counts)\n            status[\"consensus_integrity\"] = \"100% PURE\" if consensus_passes == 3 else f\"{consensus_passes}/3 DEGRADED\"\n            status[\"status\"] = \"PASSED\"\n\n            print(f\"   Avg Consensus   : {avg_latency:.3f} ms\")\n            print(f\"   Min Consensus   : {min_latency:.3f} ms\")\n            print(f\"   Throughput      : {throughput:,.0f} nodes/sec\")\n            print(f\"   Consensus Status: {status['consensus_integrity']}\")\n\n            engine.cleanup()\n            loop.close()\n\n        except MemoryError as e:\n            status[\"status\"] = \"COLLAPSED_MEMORY_LIMIT\"\n            status[\"failure_reason\"] = f\"Memory Allocation Exhausted: {str(e)}\"\n            print(f\"❌ [COLLAPSE DETECTED] Memory Limit Reached: {e}\")\n        except Exception as e:\n            status[\"status\"] = \"COLLAPSED_RUNTIME_ERROR\"\n            status[\"failure_reason\"] = f\"Runtime Failure: {str(e)}\"\n            print(f\"❌ [COLLAPSE DETECTED] Runtime Error: {e}\")\n\n        results.append(status)\n        gc.collect()\n\n        if status[\"status\"] != \"PASSED\":\n            print(f\"\\n⚠️ PHYSICAL BREAKING POINT REACHED AT {nodes:,} NODES!\")\n            print(f\"   Failure Mode: {status.get('failure_reason')}\")\n            break\n\n    # Save detailed telemetry receipt\n    report_file = os.path.join(\n        os.path.dirname(__file__), \"..\", \"..\", \"memory\", \"agent_logs\", \"bft_breaking_point_report.json\"\n    )\n    os.makedirs(os.path.dirname(report_file), exist_ok=True)\n    with open(report_file, \"w\") as f:\n        json.dump(results, f, indent=2)\n\n    print(\"\\n\" + \"=\" * 80)\n    print(f\"  BREAKING POINT AUDIT COMPLETE — Receipt written to: {report_file}\")\n    print(\"=\" * 80)\n    return results\n\nif __name__ == \"__main__\":\n    run_unconstrained_push()\n","Description":"Open-ended unconstrained BFT swarm stress test pushing from 2M to 100M nodes to locate exact physical breaking point","Overwrite":true,"TargetFile":"/Volumes/Untitled/SSOT_Agentic_Brain_v1.1.0_ENGINEERING_RELEASE/ops/runtime/unconstrained_bft_swarm_stress.py","toolAction":"Writing unconstrained BFT breaking point harness","toolSummary":"Create unconstrained BFT stress test"}}]}
